    {
      "id": "state_desc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1517.999965122768,
      "y": 198.57146344866055,
      "width": 255.0836181640625,
      "height": 370,
      "text": "输入字段：\n  sql_files: list[dict]\n  change_description: str\n\nDB 上下文：\n  db_snapshot: dict | None\n\n并行聚合（operator.add）：\n  parsed_scripts: Annotated[list, add]\n  raw_syntax_issues: Annotated[list, add]\n\n顺序分析（可选）：\n  dependency_graph: dict | None\n  db_impact: dict | None\n\n双轨并行：\n  change_verification: dict | None\n  syntax_summary: dict | None\n\n最终产出：\n  change_report_md: str\n  syntax_report_md: str\n\n控制字段：\n  errors: Annotated[list, add]\n  messages: Annotated[list, add_messages]",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
